# NOTE: in THIS variant assets/prompt_model/ is tracked via Git LFS so the repository
# contains the model weights the competition asks for. The retrieval path still works and
# short-circuits when the checkpoint is already present and hashes correctly.
# NOTE: FINALIST.lock.json is tracked deliberately. The entry point fails closed
# without it, so excluding it would break `uv run generate` on a fresh clone.
